/// A dynamic M query parameter: the SampleData partition's M consumes it by
/// name, and its view-time values are bound from DaysList[Days] via the
/// `parameterValuesColumn` property — the binding's authoritative half. A
/// consumed parameter keeps its bound column alive.
expression MinDays = 15 meta [IsParameterQuery=true, Type="Number", IsParameterQueryRequired=true]
	parameterValuesColumn: DaysList.Days
